---
import '../styles/sample-update.css';
---
<section class="wrap sample-update" id="sample-update" aria-labelledby="sample-update-title">
 <div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE RECORD / MADE USEFUL</span><h2 id="sample-update-title">KNOW WHAT MOVED.<br /><span class="v2-muted">KNOW WHAT’S NEXT.</span></h2></div><p>A useful project update connects the completed work, next steps and decisions that need a conversation.</p></div>
 <article class="sample-update-card" aria-label="Illustrative project update with fictional data">
  <header class="sample-update-header"><div><span class="sample-update-label">ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE · FICTIONAL PROJECT</span><h3>Rental-ready interior refresh</h3><p>Example update · <time datetime="2026-10-16">16 October 2026</time></p></div><span class="sample-update-stage">PREPARATION → FINISHES</span></header>
  <p class="sample-update-disclosure">All project details and figures below are fictional. This example shows how an update can be organized; it is not a completed Apex job or a live client record.</p>
  <div class="sample-update-grid">
   <section><span class="eyebrow">01 / COMPLETED WORK</span><h4>Preparation recorded complete.</h4><ul><li>Floor protection placed in the rooms included in the sample scope.</li><li>Damaged trim removed and wall preparation completed in those rooms.</li></ul></section>
   <section><span class="eyebrow">02 / UPCOMING STEPS</span><h4>Move into the finish work.</h4><ul><li>Confirm the paint selection before ordering.</li><li>Paint the prepared rooms, then fit the replacement trim.</li></ul></section>
   <section><span class="eyebrow">03 / DECISIONS NEEDED</span><h4>Two items to discuss.</h4><ul><li>Select warm white or soft cream for the living area.</li><li>Decide whether to include the additional rear-entry trim repair.</li></ul><p class="sample-update-status">SELECTION OPEN · SCOPE QUESTION OPEN</p></section>
   <section><span class="eyebrow">04 / BUDGET &amp; CHANGE STATUS</span><h4>Keep the figures in context.</h4><dl><div><dt>Recorded contract amount</dt><dd>$48,000</dd></div><div><dt>Recorded payments</dt><dd>$12,000</dd></div><div><dt>Possible trim addition</dt><dd>$650 estimate</dd></div></dl><p>The possible addition is open for discussion and is excluded from the recorded amount above. All amounts are illustrative.</p></section>
  </div>
  <footer class="sample-update-footer"><p>The portal’s task list, dated project journal, scope notes, payment records and documents provide the supporting detail. Updates reflect information entered by the project team.</p><p>This text-only example includes no site photographs.</p></footer>
 </article>
</section>
